	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "HRO TYPE-C-31-M-13C (LCSC C2848620) 16-pin USB 2.0 Type-C receptacle, mid-mount (sink board). Land from the LCSC official EasyEDA package USB-C-SMD_TYPE-C-31-M-13C, checked against the HRO drawing (2021-03-06): 9.24 mm board slot 6.54 mm deep, shell 8.94 wide, 1.60 above the board top, 3.16 tall. Mouth faces +Y at rot 0; the slot opens at y = +4.70, which must sit on the board edge. Contact heels trimmed from -2.00 to -2.04 so copper is 0.20 mm (JLC floor) from the slot. VBUS/GND contact pairs share one 0.6 mm pad, as on the vendor land.")
